---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { business } from '../config/business';
---
<Layout title="Privacy | Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service" description="How Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service uses information shared through a walkthrough inquiry.">
  <article class="privacy-page container prose"><p class="eyebrow">Your information</p><h1>Privacy,<br/><em>in plain language.</em></h1><p class="intro-lead">We use the details you choose to share to discuss your workplace and respond to your inquiry.</p><h2>Who provides the service</h2><p>Service is provided by {business.legalProvider}, owner-operated by Blake Bannon. Fenrir is the public-facing business name.</p><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>A walkthrough inquiry asks for your name, business name, town, and a phone number or email address. You may also share your business address, business type, approximate size, cleaning preferences, and a short description.</p><h2>How it is used</h2><p>Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service uses inquiry information to contact you, understand the work you’re considering, and prepare or discuss a proposal. Submitting an inquiry does not sign you up for marketing or book an appointment. We do not sell inquiry information.</p><h2>Processing and security</h2><p>When online inquiries are available, the website’s hosting provider processes the request, Cloudflare Turnstile checks for spam, and an email delivery provider passes the inquiry to the business. These providers may process technical information such as an IP address for delivery and abuse prevention. Inquiry details are kept only as needed to respond, manage a potential business relationship, or meet applicable recordkeeping needs.</p><p>Please do not include payment information, keys, alarm codes, or sensitive building or personal information in an inquiry.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This website does not use advertising trackers or analytics tools. Fonts and site imagery are hosted with the website. When the inquiry form is enabled, Cloudflare Turnstile may use browser signals to help prevent automated submissions. Hosting providers may keep standard access and security logs.</p><h2>Questions or corrections</h2><p>Contact Blake Bannon to ask about your inquiry information or request a correction or deletion, subject to applicable recordkeeping requirements.</p>{business.email && <p><a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a></p>}{business.phone && <p><a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phone}</a></p>}<p><a href="/request-walkthrough">View inquiry and contact options <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p></article>
</Layout>
